GIVEN `the delegator is a specified officer or the holder of a specified office` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person who was the specified officer or holder when the delegation was made ceases to be the officer or holder of the office` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the delegation continues in force and the person for the time being occupying or acting in the office is taken to be the delegator (s 27A(8A))` IS
    IF `the delegator is a specified officer or the holder of a specified office` AND `the person who was the specified officer or holder when the delegation was made ceases to be the officer or holder of the office`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING

-- src:530 | (8B) If—
-- src:531 | (a) the delegator is a body; and
-- src:532 | (b) there is a change in the membership of the body;
-- src:533 | then—
-- src:534 | (c) the delegation continues in force; and
