    IF `the document purports to be a certificate mentioned in subsection (14)` AND (NOT `the contrary is established`) THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING

-- src:546 | (15A) Authority to delegate a person’s or body’s powers includes authority to delegate doing an act or making a decision for performing a function of the person or body.
@ref s 27A(15A) (src:546-546)
