GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `authority to delegate a person's or body's powers includes that authority (s 27A(15A))` IS
    IF `it is authority to delegate doing an act or making a decision for performing a function of the person or body` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING

-- src:547 | (16) In this section—
