    IF `part of the resolution would, apart from s 29, be interpreted as exceeding authority` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING

-- src:563 | (2) Without limiting subsection (1), if part of a resolution would, apart from this section, be interpreted as exceeding authority—
-- src:564 | (a) the resolution is valid to the extent to which it does not exceed authority; and
-- src:565 | (b) the remainder of the resolution is not affected.
