    IF `part of the resolution would, apart from s 29, be interpreted as exceeding authority` THEN JUST FALSE ELSE NOTHING

-- src:566 | (3) Without limiting subsection (1), if the application of part of a resolution to a person, matter or circumstance would, apart from this section, be interpreted as exceeding authority, the part’s application to other persons, matters or circumstances is not affected.
@ref s 29(3) (src:566-566)
GIVEN `the application of part of the resolution to a person, matter or circumstance would, apart from s 29, be interpreted as exceeding authority` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the part's application to other persons, matters or circumstances is affected (s 29(3))` IS
    IF `the application of part of the resolution to a person, matter or circumstance would, apart from s 29, be interpreted as exceeding authority` THEN JUST FALSE ELSE NOTHING

-- src:567 | (4) This section applies to an Act in addition to, and without limiting, any provision of the Act.
