DECLARE `Sitting day of the Legislative Assembly` HAS
    `the Parliament it falls in` IS A NUMBER
    `the session of Parliament it falls in` IS A NUMBER
    `the day` IS A DATE

-- s 29B: in working out a particular number of sitting days, it does not matter whether the days are within the same or different Parliaments or within different sessions.
-- src:570 | In working out a particular number of sitting days of the Legislative Assembly, it does not matter whether the days are within the same or different Parliaments or within different sessions of Parliament.
@ref s 29B (src:570-570)
GIVEN `the sitting days` IS A LIST OF `Sitting day of the Legislative Assembly`
GIVETH A NUMBER
